  "html": "<div id=\"question-22036\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">6.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/263#3085\">Calculating the Length of a Hypotenuse or Leg of a 45-45-90 Triangle Given its Perimeter</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"22036\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-22036\"></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>The perimeter of the above triangle is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"44\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Find the measure of each leg.</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Fri, Oct 16th @ 2:30 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 1:04</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
